  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/06/IMG_3332.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">La ma&ntilde;ana de este viernes se han puesto en funcionamiento el sem&aacute;foro y el bolardo que regulan el tr&aacute;fico temporal entre El Pla y el Raval de Sant Josep de Onda. De momento, se puede pasar de lunes a viernes de 9 a 13 horas, coincidiendo con el horario escolar de junio. A las 13 horas se ha vuelto a levantar el bolardo y el sem&aacute;foro ha pasado a rojo. A las 9 del lunes bajar&aacute; el bolardo y el sem&aacute;foro pasar&aacute; a &aacute;mbar.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/semaforelplaravalonda/img_3329.jpg\" alt=\"img_3329\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/semaforelplaravalonda/img_3330.jpg\" alt=\"img_3330\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/semaforelplaravalonda/img_3331.jpg\" alt=\"img_3331\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/semaforelplaravalonda/img_3332.jpg\" alt=\"img_3332\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/semaforelplaravalonda/img_3333.jpg\" alt=\"img_3333\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/semaforelplaravalonda/img_3334.jpg\" alt=\"img_3334\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/semaforelplaravalonda/img_3335.jpg\" alt=\"img_3335\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/semaforelplaravalonda/img_3336.jpg\" alt=\"img_3336\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/semaforelplaravalonda/img_3337.jpg\" alt=\"img_3337\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/semaforelplaravalonda/img_3338.jpg\" alt=\"img_3338\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
